# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRIVATE-SOURCE BOUNDARY — never commit copyrighted book material or anything
# derived from it. This block is load-bearing; the pre-commit guard enforces it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
development-private/
*.epub
*.pdf
*.docx
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3

# Extracted / OCR'd source text and analysis (belt-and-suspenders; also under
# development-private/, but guard against strays anywhere in the tree)
**/extracted/
**/ocr/
**/concept-cards/
*.ocr.txt
*.extract.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build / generated artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
*.tgz
*.zip
checksums.txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local agent-harness / tool state — machine-local, never part of the shipped
# system. Never tracked; listed explicitly so nothing here is committed by
# accident.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.claude-flow/

# Allow synthetic test fixtures explicitly (they are NOT real book content).
# These are tiny hand-made EPUB/PDF files created for the repo.
!tests/fixtures/**
